# DECSC/DECRC are per screen. An application saving the cursor on the alternate
# screen must not clobber the position the shell saved on the primary one.
size: 10x4
description: each screen keeps its own saved cursor

--- input
\e[3;5H\e7\e[?1049h\e[1;1H\e7\e[?1049l\e8

--- expect-cursor
row=2 col=4
